st:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal\"><span><ruby>一番<rt>いちばん</rt></ruby><ruby>最初<rt>さいしょ</rt></ruby>の<ruby>思い出<rt>おもいで</rt></ruby>は、やっぱり<ruby>握手<rt>あくしゅ</rt></ruby><ruby>会<rt>かい</rt></ruby>！</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal\"><span>さりなちゃんの<ruby>握手<rt>あくしゅ</rt></ruby><ruby>会<rt>かい</rt></ruby>は<ruby>本当<rt>ほんとう</rt></ruby>にすごいんですよ！</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal;min-height:22px\"><span></span><br></p><p style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal;min-height:22px\"><span></span><br></p><p style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal\"><span><ruby>初<rt>はじ</rt></ruby>めてのペアレーン。さりなちゃんと<ruby>一緒<rt>いっしょ</rt></ruby>でした。</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal\"><span><ruby>本当<rt>ほんとう</rt></ruby><ruby>優<rt>やさ</rt></ruby>しい<ruby>方<rt>ほう</rt></ruby>ばかりで、ファンは<ruby>推<rt>お</rt></ruby>しに<ruby>似<rt>に</rt></ruby>るっていう<ruby>言葉<rt>ことば</rt></ruby>は<ruby>本当<rt>ほんとう</rt></ruby>なんだ！と<ruby>思<rt>おも</rt></ruby>った<ruby>記憶<rt>きおく</rt></ruby>があります。</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal;min-height:22px\"><span></span><br></p><p style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal;min-height:22px\"><span></span><br></p><p style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal\"><span>その<ruby>後<rt>ご</rt></ruby>も<ruby>先輩<rt>せんぱい</rt></ruby></span><span>×</span><span><ruby>後輩<rt>こうはい</rt></ruby>のペアになる<ruby>時<rt>とき</rt></ruby>は</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal\" dir=\"auto\"><span>さりなちゃんと<ruby>一緒<rt>いっしょ</rt></ruby>になることが<ruby>多<rt>おお</rt></ruby>く、</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal;min-height:22px\"><span></span><br></p><p style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal;min-height:22px\"><span></span><br></p><p style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal\"><span>HINABINGO!</span><span>の<ruby>姉妹<rt>しまい</rt></ruby><ruby>企画<rt>きかく</rt></ruby>で<ruby>生<rt>う</rt></ruby>まれた「<ruby>代官山<rt>だいかんやま</rt></ruby><ruby>姉妹<rt>しまい</rt></ruby>」やキュンのヒット<ruby>祈願<rt>きがん</rt></ruby>で<ruby>駅伝<rt>えきでん</rt></ruby>もご<ruby>一緒<rt>いっしょ</rt></ruby>させて<ruby>頂<rt>いただ</rt></ruby>きました。</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal;min-height:22px\"><span></span><br></p><p style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal;min-height:22px\"><span></span><br></p><p style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal\" dir=\"auto\"><span><ruby>多分<rt>たぶん</rt></ruby>、<ruby>私<rt>わたし</rt></ruby>が<ruby>精神<rt>せいしん</rt></ruby><ruby>的<rt>てき</rt></ruby>に<ruby>幼<rt>おさな</rt></ruby>かったので、マネージャーさんから<ruby>見<rt>み</rt></ruby>て<ruby>学<rt>まな</rt></ruby>ぶように！という<ruby>教訓<rt>きょうくん</rt></ruby>が<ruby>込<rt>こ</rt></ruby>められていたのかなと<ruby>思<rt>おも</rt></ruby>います。</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal\"><span><br></span></p><p style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal;min-height:22px\"><span></span><br></p><p style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal;min-height:22px\"><span></span><br></p><p style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal\"><span>1</span><span><ruby>番<rt>ばん</rt></ruby><ruby>先輩<rt>せんぱい</rt></ruby>と<ruby>馴染<rt>なじ</rt></ruby>むのが<ruby>遅<rt>おそ</rt></ruby>かった<ruby>私<rt>わたし</rt></ruby>でしたが、</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal\"><span>さりなちゃんはいつも<ruby>笑顔<rt>えがお</rt></ruby>で<ruby>話<rt>はな</rt></ruby>して<ruby>下<rt>くだ</rt></ruby>さって。</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal\"><span>だんだん<ruby>素<rt>もと</rt></ruby>の<ruby>自分<rt>じぶん</rt></ruby>を<ruby>出<rt>だ</rt></ruby>せるようになりました。</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal;min-height:22px\"><span></span><br></p><p style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal;min-height:22px\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal;min-height:22px\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal;min-height:22px\" dir=\"auto\"><ruby>後輩<rt>こうはい</rt></ruby>が<ruby>増<rt>ふ</rt></ruby>えていくにつれて、<ruby>受<rt>う</rt></ruby>けていた<ruby>愛<rt>あい</rt></ruby>の<ruby>偉大<rt>いだい</rt></ruby>さが<ruby>増<rt>ま</rt></ruby>していき、さりなちゃんほど<ruby>完璧<rt>かんぺき</rt></ruby>ではないけれど、この<ruby>想<rt>おも</rt></ruby>いを<ruby>繋<rt>つな</rt></ruby>げていこうと<ruby>思<rt>おも</rt></ruby>うようになりました。</p><p style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal;min-height:22px\" dir=\"auto\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal;min-height:22px\" dir=\"auto\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-nume